ks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gpP24"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f78a1698-4490-461c-ab25-6abfd278c812","type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"なぜだかファイルの種類がバイナリになってしまっていますが，ただのテキストファイルです。","ts":"1629468901.063900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VzWd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"207a3720-20d3-4bd1-944c-b0e04a9a13c1","type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"`nvim -V9trace,log` の結果です。\n\nHomebrewでインストールしたNeovimはちゃんとARM64なバイナリになっているようです。","ts":"1629468864.063500","files":[{"id":"F02C1CB7160","created":1629468863,"timestamp":1629468863,"name":"trace.log","title":"trace.log","mimetype":"application/octet-stream","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"binary","pretty_type":"バイナリ","user":"U021P814T51","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":61448,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02C1CB7160/trace.log","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02C1CB7160/download/trace.log","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U021P814T51/F02C1CB7160/trace.log","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F02C1CB7160-3fc6f629fe","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"username":""}],"upload":true,"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z3e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a055afe-c1de-4fe8-8f92-119c45a9028c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"`nvim -V9trace.log` でカレントディレクトリにログファイルが出力されますので、それを稲妻アイコン→Slack→テキストのスニペットを作成するでここに貼ってもらった方が解決が早いかも。","ts":"1629468545.063100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4qS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddb1106f-5fa8-40b5-ba1b-760d43435772","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Neovimにログ吐き出させるオプションあったかな…。","ts":"1629468178.061100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7W8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21ede17d-3d91-4c83-a8e6-bddc3c072e6d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"homebrew だと arm64 の bottle が入りそうなんだけどなぁ。\n\u003chttps://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/5f1f58b18200e6b88f91d264a024354320941bcd/Formula/neovim.rb#L10\u003e","ts":"1629467930.060600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/5f1f58b18200e6b88f91d264a024354320941bcd/Formula/neovim.rb | neovim.rb\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/5f1f58b18200e6b88f91d264a024354320941bcd/Formula/neovim.rb | neovim.rb\u003e","text":"```\n    sha256 arm64_big_sur: \"8c2031ed12ca5a2af5d317f74a3878b2acdfc8b8bd61f8c58ca99b52bfc2f29a\"\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core|Homebrew/homebrew-core\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SwWV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43f2df04-3c1d-4f51-9e9c-c5d8db066300","type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"Homebrewを利用したビルドですが，中でやっていることとしては普通にソースをダウンロードしてきて， `cmake .. \u0026amp;\u0026amp; make \u0026amp;\u0026amp; make install` です。 リンクされているライブラリが違うだけみたいです。","ts":"1629467776.059600","edited":{"user":"U021P814T51","ts":"1629467791.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HMB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f11dfa5-8d34-4054-9396-0df35a738668","type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"`brew reinstall nvim --build-from-source` して手元でビルドしたNeovimでは上記の問題が再現しました。 GitHub ReleasesからダウンロードしてきたNeovimは(今のところ)問題が再現しません。もしかすると依存関係のなにかが悪さをしているのかもしれません。","ts":"1629467700.058200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"he3DD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a31aa66-bccd-4c10-98e7-077717af120a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"やっぱ自前ビルドが鉄板なんですね。特殊なアーキテクチャになると。","ts":"1629467668.057900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xo91+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efe84da8-4f6c-4870-b30b-42442bc29703","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"おっ、 heavenshell  さん Neovim 詳しい...","ts":"1629467302.055500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c69c05f0-8a1f-4eef-a959-e7ac2d89dd87","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://neovim.discourse.group/t/tree-sitter-on-m1-mac/401/7\u003e\n↑のバイナリー動いたとしても Rosetta2 経由みたいですね。","ts":"1629467205.054900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Neovim Discourse: Tree Sitter on M1 Mac?","id":1,"title":"Tree Sitter on M1 Mac?","title_link":"https://neovim.discourse.group/t/tree-sitter-on-m1-mac/401/7","text":"Yes, the most commonly available pre-built binaries for the nightly version are Intel-only. Building from source is pretty easy. If you use brew, it’ll take under a minute. You can also build straight from the repo, which takes slightly longer (but not by much) as you’ll also need to build the dependencies.","thumb_url":"https://aws1.discourse-cdn.com/free1/uploads/neovim/original/1X/2b245c788ae35dd3fbdec97f7d8332a74b72bff7.png","blocks":null,"ts":1618054939,"service_name":"Neovim Discourse","service_icon":"https://aws1.discourse-cdn.com/free1/uploads/neovim/optimized/1X/2b245c788ae35dd3fbdec97f7d8332a74b72bff7_2_180x180.png","thumb_width":1204,"thumb_height":1468,"from_url":"https://neovim.discourse.group/t/tree-sitter-on-m1-mac/401/7","original_url":"https://neovim.discourse.group/t/tree-sitter-on-m1-mac/401/7"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PQz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7D3DAA05-3BA0-49EC-98F3-BC6847FDD04F","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"一応、リリースにはバイナリもあります。M1 mac で動くかは試してないです \u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases|https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases\u003e","ts":"1629466963.054100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xH4eQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"416DF012-C1D1-487B-9A2F-D650E13B98BB","type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"試してみます。","ts":"1629466269.052000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sS93B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07e83659-9e35-4e33-8700-98985a019642","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"同じ問題が発生しますか","ts":"1629466259.051600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rQT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f29c44af-ebb6-44ce-9147-ae36a0f592a2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"手でneovimビルドしてみてはどうですか","ts":"1629466253.051300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HQpo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"235C2F3D-D956-4AFF-B70F-17C081CC5DA5","type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"画像ではシンタックスファイルがタイムアウトしているのですが，この部分はNeovimを起動するごとに変化して，例えばmattnさんのvim-lsp-settingsのファイルがタイムアウトしていることもあります。","ts":"1629466237.050900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YsTT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2eecc325-f541-42b3-a1ea-60c7e67f1f4d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"M1 macでhomebrewとはややこしい環境だなぁ","ts":"1629466235.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i7j2S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f11bebf0-223d-48c0-af62-8afe9b2afadb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"シンタックスファイルがタイムアウトしてるのかな","ts":"1629466155.048100","edited":{"user":"U7JL1UKKL","ts":"1629466161.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/QIIs"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"こんばんは。初歩的な質問かもしれませんが，自力で解決できないので教えてください。\nM1なmacOSでHomebrewを使用してインストールしたNeovim(`nvim`; バージョンは0.5)でdein.vimを利用したいのですが，画像の通りのvimrcで `Parse … error: Timeout 10000ms` というエラーが出ます。\n何が悪いのでしょうか？教えていただけると幸いです。\n\nちなみに通常のVimでこれとまったく同じ設定をしていますが，エラーメッセージは表示されません。`:checkhealth` ではPython2とPerlのライブラリが見つからないと言われますが，dein.vimとは関係ないので無視して良いものと思っています。","ts":"1629465885.047700","files":[{"id":"F02BUVCPSPL","created":1629465776,"timestamp":1629465776,"name":"Screenshot 2021-08-20 22.19.40.png","title":"Screenshot 2021-08-20 22.19.40.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U021P814T51","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":1037682,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BUVCPSPL/screenshot_2021-08-20_22.19.40.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BUVCPSPL/download/screenshot_2021-08-20_22.19.40.png","original_h":2006,"original_w":2988,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02BUVCPSPL-ff180b376a/screenshot_2021-08-20_22.19.40_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02BUVCPSPL-ff180b376a/screenshot_2021-08-20_22.19.40_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02BUVCPSPL-ff180b376a/screenshot_2021-08-20_22.19.40_160.png","thum