":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/cw9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b76e430-b33e-4e1f-826b-a02f49cbc312","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"直ってるみたいです、ありがとうございます！","ts":"1629458696.043100","thread_ts":"1629441701.038500","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kwz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b0dd21a-ee24-4417-84e5-d0df930ef4b2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"よかった","ts":"1629461433.043300","thread_ts":"1629441701.038500","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xdr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c815d7c-1f56-404b-b29e-7169363970ca","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ難易度的にどんなもんか想像ってつきます？","ts":"1629433440.018800","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y2cab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2DEF292F-DD80-4DE3-A39A-0F5DFF1C5D2E","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"treesitter の構文って基本的に grammar.js というファイルの中で記述されてるんですよね。そこを読んで、書かれている構文要素のどれに関数の syntax が対応してるか、などが分かれば、クエリファイルを作るのはそんなに難しくはないと思います。\n（もしも所望の動作を実現するために grammat.js をいじる必要がある、みたいな事態になってしまったらかなり面倒くさそうですが、関数定義全体に対応するノードはまずあると思うので「関数定義全体を消す」ぐらいの動作はできるんじゃないかと睨んでます）","ts":"1629434009.025700","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1629434228.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rcd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4F11F839-BF5C-4071-BD22-F27152DB6969","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もしかすると TSEditQuery コマンドを使えば手元で試せるかも…？（やったことない）","ts":"1629434050.026900","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"770V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e499fd78-4758-4148-8ebd-7f8b68d4d087","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"見たことないコマンドだ","ts":"1629434303.027600","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4EYQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6936F608-3472-400E-835D-E9408A5ABD26","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ちょっと試してみましたが、TSEditQuery でクエリファイルいじってからバッファ再読み込みすることで、ハイライトとか自分の好きにいじれますね。なので textobj も変えられるんじゃないかと。（ただplugin 本体のファイルを直接いじってそうなのが気になりますが試験的に挙動を確かめるのに使う分には問題なさそう）","ts":"1629434606.030700","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1629434639.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BMu3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11E5FDD7-0B15-4D9A-A3C7-ACBC2D23BF3C","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あ、ユーザ固有の設定は TSEditQueryUserAfter を使えば良さげですね","ts":"1629434871.031800","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J5INf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7782303e-09ec-4c95-8b2b-c176899fe80d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"書きたいけど何も分からんからちょっとハードルが高い","ts":"1629438565.033800","thread_ts":"1629431705.017500","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s+9m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccfcc20b-d0ed-4c35-98e3-82f8428a5a39","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"tsx 何もわからないですが、基本的には typescript と似たような文法なんですかね？\nとりあえず\n```TSEditQueryUserAfter textobjects tsx```\nで出てくるバッファに、以下のファイルと同じ内容を書き込んでみました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter-textobjects/blob/master/queries/javascript/textobjects.scm\u003e\nそうすると filetype が typescriptreact でもとりあえず `daf` で関数全体が消せるよう